# Cesium

- JS tracks: CesiumJS from npm, TypeScript, Vite.
- Native tracks: official Cesium for Unreal or Unity plugin.
- Domain does not import Viewer / Cesium3DTileset. Adapter at the seam.
- WGS84 / ECEF in domain. Engine coords are an Adapter.
- Ion tokens from env only.
- Read TRACK.md. Do not add Unreal work on a JS track.
